  codec-oracles/rlgrdiff/src/main.rs  (Bits, encode, decode and their helpers)
      Copied from ironrdp-graphics 0.9.0, src/utils.rs and src/rlgr.rs. One
      change: the Golomb-Rice update in encode() selects UQ_GR or UP_GR from the
      FIX_UQ environment variable, to test which upstream intended.

  codec-oracles/dwtdiff/ours.rs
  codec-oracles/dwtdiff/ours_clamped.rs
  codec-oracles/dwtdiff/probe.rs
      Copied from ironrdp-graphics 0.9.0, src/dwt_extrapolate.rs, with the test
      module removed and a harness main() added. ours_clamped.rs saturates in
      t() where ours.rs truncates. Verified near-verbatim by normalised diff
      against the published crate.

  codec-oracles/dwtcmp/main.rs  (idwt_row, idwt_col, decode_block, decode)
      Adapted from the same file, with the narrowing function t lifted to a
      parameter so both behaviours can be driven from one binary.

  surface-repro/s2s/src/surface.rs is a stale snapshot of mdrdp's own
      src/surface.rs, not third-party.

